  <article class="problem">
    <div class="p-head"><span class="pts">1. (2+2b)</span><a class="tag" href="#typ-vztahy">tabuľka vzťahov</a></div>
    <p class="prompt">Rozhodnite o každom zo vzťahov \((O,o,\Omega,\omega,\Theta,\sim)\) medzi funkciami \(f,g\), resp. \(F,G\) a svoje tvrdenie zdôvodnite.<br>(a)&nbsp;\(f(n)=\log_3 n+\log_3\log_3 n\), \(g(n)=\dfrac{\ln n}{\ln 2}+100\). &nbsp; (b)&nbsp;\(F(n)=\sqrt[3]{n}\), \(G(n)=\sqrt[4]{n}\,\ln n\).</p>
    <p class="read-note">Fotka je v (a) rozmazaná. Čítam základ 3 pri \(f\) a \(\ln n/\ln 2\) pri \(g\). Ak by \(f\) malo základ 2, vyšla by limita 1 a platilo by aj \(\sim\).</p>
    <details class="sol" open><summary><span class="closed-label">Ukázať riešenie</span><span class="open-label">Riešenie</span></summary><div class="sol-body">
      <p><b>(a)</b> \(\log_3\log_3 n=o(\log_3 n)\) a \(g(n)=\log_2 n+100\). Vydeľ \(\log_3 n=\ln n/\ln 3\):</p>
      <div class="disp">\[L=\lim\frac{1+\frac{\log_3\log_3 n}{\log_3 n}}{\frac{\ln 3}{\ln 2}+\frac{100}{\log_3 n}}=\frac{1}{\ln3/\ln2}=\frac{\ln 2}{\ln 3}\approx0{,}631 .\]</div>
      <p><b>(b)</b> \(\dfrac{F}{G}=\dfrac{n^{1/3}}{n^{1/4}\ln n}=\dfrac{n^{1/12}}{\ln n}\). L'Hospital: \(\dfrac{\frac1{12}n^{-11/12}}{1/n}=\dfrac{n^{1/12}}{12}\to\infty\).</p>
      <div class="scroll"><table class="rel">
        <thead><tr><th></th><th>\(O\)</th><th>\(o\)</th><th>\(\Omega\)</th><th>\(\omega\)</th><th>\(\Theta\)</th><th>\(\sim\)</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>(a)&nbsp;\(L=\ln2/\ln3\)</td><td class="y">✓</td><td class="n">×</td><td class="y">✓</td><td class="n">×</td><td class="y">✓</td><td class="n">×</td></tr>
          <tr><td>(b)&nbsp;\(L=\infty\)</td><td class="n">×</td><td class="n">×</td><td class="y">✓</td><td class="y">✓</td><td class="n">×</td><td class="n">×</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table></div>
    </div></details>
  </article>

  <article class="problem">
    <div class="p-head"><span class="pts">2. (3b)</span><a class="tag" href="#typ-cykly">presný počet</a></div>
    <p class="prompt">Určte výpočtom presný počet hviezdičiek, ktoré vypíše procA.</p>
<pre class="code">void procA (int n) {
  int i,j;
  for (i=2; i&lt;3*n; ++i) {
    printf("***");
    for (j=i-1; j&lt;2*i; ++j)
      printf("**");
  }
}</pre>
    <details class="sol" open><summary><span class="closed-label">Ukázať riešenie</span><span class="open-label">Riešenie</span></summary><div class="sol-body">
      <p>\(i=2,\dots,3n-1\): \(3n-2\) prechodov (\(n\ge1\)). Vnútorný cyklus: \(2i-(i-1)=i+1\) prechodov. Člen sumy je \(3+2(i+1)=2i+5\).</p>
      <div class="disp">\[T(n)=\sum_{i=2}^{3n-1}(2i+5)=(3n-2)\cdot\frac{9+(6n+3)}{2}=(3n-2)(3n+6).\]</div>
      <div class="ans"><b>Výsledok</b>\(T(n)=9n^2+12n-12\) pre \(n\ge1\)</div>
      <p class="check" style="margin-top:8px">Kontrola \(n=1\): \(i=2\), \(3+2\cdot3=9\)&nbsp;✓</p>
    </div></details>
  </article>

  <article class="problem">
    <div class="p-head"><span class="pts">3. (3b)</span><a class="tag" href="#typ-odhad">odhad ~</a></div>
    <p class="prompt">Určte výpočtom čo najpresnejšie (pomocou \(\sim\) notácie) počet hviezdičiek, ktoré vypíše procB.</p>
<pre class="code">void procB (int n) {
  int i,j;
  for (i=1; i&lt;=n; ++i) {
    for (j=1; j&lt;=sqrt(i); ++j)
      printf("***");
  }
}</pre>
    <details class="sol" open><summary><span class="closed-label">Ukázať riešenie</span><span class="open-label">Riešenie</span></summary><div class="sol-body">
      <p>Vnútorný cyklus beží \(\lfloor\sqrt i\rfloor\)-krát, takže \(T(n)=3\sum_{i=1}^n\lfloor\sqrt i\rfloor\). Označ \(S=\sum_{i=1}^n\sqrt i\). Keďže \(\sqrt i-1&lt;\lfloor\sqrt i\rfloor\le\sqrt i\), platí \(3(S-n)&lt;T(n)\le3S\).</p>
      <p>\(\sqrt x\) je rastúca, preto</p>
      <div class="disp">\[\tfrac23n^{3/2}=\int_0^n\sqrt x\,dx\;\le\;S\;\le\;\int_1^{n+1}\sqrt x\,dx=\tfrac23\big((n+1)^{3/2}-1\big).\]</div>
      <p>Obe hranice sú \(\sim\frac23n^{3/2}\), teda aj \(S\sim\frac23n^{3/2}\). Člen \(n\) je \(o(n^{3/2})\), takže zaokrúhlenie nadol nič nemení.</p>
      <div class="ans"><b>Výsledok</b>\(T(n)\sim 3\cdot\tfrac23n^{3/2}=2n^{3/2}=2n\sqrt n\)</div>
    </div></details>
  </article>

  <article class="problem">
    <div class="p-head"><span class="pts">4. (2+2+1b)</span><a class="tag" href="#typ-mt">master theorem</a></div>
    <p class="prompt">Použite Master Theorem na riešenie rekurencií. Riešenia zdôvodnite!<br>a)&nbsp;\(T(n)=8T(n/3)+n^2\log n\), &nbsp; b)&nbsp;\(T(n)=2T(n/4)+\sqrt n\log n\), &nbsp; c)&nbsp;\(T(n)=3T(n/3)+\sqrt n\log n\).</p>
    <details class="sol" open><summary><span class="closed-label">Ukázať riešenie</span><span class="open-label">Riešenie</span></summary><div class="sol-body">
      <p><b>a)</b> \(p=\log_3 8\approx1{,}893\), \(d=2&gt;p\), teda MT3. Pre \(\varepsilon=0{,}1\): \(\lim\frac{n^2\log n}{n^{1{,}993}}=\infty\). Regularita:</p>
      <div class="disp">\[8\,(n/3)^2\log(n/3)=\tfrac89n^2(\log n-\log3)\le\tfrac89n^2\log n,\qquad c=\tfrac89&lt;1.\]</div>
      <div class="ans"><b>a)</b>\(T(n)=\Theta(n^2\log n)\)</div>
      <p style="margin-top:14px"><b>b)</b> \(p=\log_4 2=\tfrac12\), \(f=\sqrt n\log n=\Theta(n^{1/2}\log^1 n)\), teda MT2 s \(k=1\).</p>
      <div class="ans"><b>b)</b>\(T(n)=\Theta(\sqrt n\log^2 n)\)</div>
      <p style="margin-top:14px"><b>c)</b> \(p=\log_3 3=1\), \(f=\sqrt n\log n\). Pre \(\varepsilon=\tfrac14\): \(\lim\frac{\sqrt n\log n}{n^{3/4}}=\lim\frac{\log n}{n^{1/4}}=0\), teda MT1.</p>
      <div class="ans"><b>c)</b>\(T(n)=\Theta(n)\)</div>
    </div></details>
  </article>

  <article class="problem">
    <div class="p-head"><span class="pts">5. (5b)</span><a class="tag" href="#typ-rekurzia">rekurencia</a></div>
    <p class="prompt">Určte výpočtom presný počet hviezdičiek, ktoré vypíše procC.</p>
<pre class="code">void procC (int n) {
  int i;
  if (n&gt;1) {
    procC(n-2);
    for (i=0; i&lt;n; i++)
      printf("****");
  }
}</pre>
    <details class="sol" open><summary><span class="closed-label">Ukázať riešenie</span><span class="open-label">Riešenie</span></summary><div class="sol-body">
      <div class="disp">\[T(n)=T(n-2)+4n\ \ (n\ge2),\qquad T(0)=T(1)=0.\]</div>
      <p>\(d_n=\alpha+\beta(-1)^n\). Číslo 1 je koreň, preto \(b_n=n(An+B)\): \(4An-4A+2B=4n\Rightarrow A=1,\ B=2\), teda \(b_n=n^2+2n\).</p>
      <p>\(T(n)=n^2+2n+\alpha+\beta(-1)^n\). Z \(T(0)=0\): \(\alpha+\beta=0\). Z \(T(1)=0\): \(3+\alpha-\beta=0\). Odtiaľ \(\alpha=-\tfrac32,\ \beta=\tfrac32\).</p>
      <div class="ans"><b>Výsledok</b>\(T(n)=n^2+2n-\tfrac32+\tfrac32(-1)^n\): párne \(n\) dáva \(n^2+2n\), nepárne \(n^2+2n-3\)</div>
      <p class="check" style="margin-top:8px">Kontrola: \(T(2)=8\)&nbsp;✓, \(T(3)=T(1)+12=12\)&nbsp;✓, \(T(4)=8+16=24\)&nbsp;✓. Rozvinutím pre \(n=2k\): \(4(2+4+\dots+2k)=4k(k+1)=n(n+2)\)&nbsp;✓</p>
    </div></details>
  </article>
</div>

