  <article class="problem">
    <div class="p-head"><span class="pts">4. (2+2+1b)</span><a class="tag" href="#typ-mt">master theorem</a></div>
    <p class="prompt">Použite Master Theorem na riešenie rekurencií. Riešenia zdôvodnite!<br>a)&nbsp;\(T(n)=8T(n/3)+(n\log n)^2\), &nbsp; b)&nbsp;\(T(n)=9T(n/3)+(n\log n)^2\), &nbsp; c)&nbsp;\(T(n)=10T(n/3)+(n\log n)^2\).</p>
    <details class="sol" open><summary><span class="closed-label">Ukázať riešenie</span><span class="open-label">Riešenie</span></summary><div class="sol-body">
      <p>Všade \(f(n)=n^2\log^2 n\) a \(b=3\). Mení sa len \(a\), a tým aj prípad MT.</p>
      <p><b>a)</b> \(p=\log_3 8\approx1{,}893&lt;2\), teda MT3, \(\varepsilon=0{,}1\). Regularita: \(8f(n/3)=\frac89n^2\log^2\frac n3\le\frac89f(n)\), \(c=\frac89\)&nbsp;✓</p>
      <div class="ans"><b>a)</b>\(T(n)=\Theta(n^2\log^2 n)\)</div>
      <p style="margin-top:14px"><b>b)</b> \(p=\log_3 9=2\), \(f=\Theta(n^2\log^2 n)\), teda MT2 s \(k=2\).</p>
      <div class="ans"><b>b)</b>\(T(n)=\Theta(n^2\log^3 n)\)</div>
      <p style="margin-top:14px"><b>c)</b> \(p=\log_3 10\approx2{,}096&gt;2\), teda MT1. Pre \(\varepsilon=0{,}05\): \(\lim\frac{n^2\log^2 n}{n^{2{,}046}}=\lim\frac{\log^2 n}{n^{0{,}046}}=0\).</p>
      <div class="ans"><b>c)</b>\(T(n)=\Theta(n^{\log_3 10})\)</div>
    </div></details>
  </article>

  <article class="problem">
    <div class="p-head"><span class="pts">5. (5b)</span><a class="tag" href="#typ-rekurzia">rekurencia</a></div>
    <p class="prompt">Určte výpočtom presný počet hviezdičiek, ktoré vypíše procC.</p>
<pre class="code">void procC (int n) {
  int i;
  if (n&gt;1) {
    procC(n-2);
    procC(n-1);
    procC(n-2);
    for (i=0; i&lt;n; i++)
      printf("****");
  }
}</pre>
    <details class="sol" open><summary><span class="closed-label">Ukázať riešenie</span><span class="open-label">Riešenie</span></summary><div class="sol-body">
      <div class="disp">\[T(n)=T(n-1)+2T(n-2)+4n\ \ (n\ge2),\qquad T(0)=T(1)=0.\]</div>
      <p><b>Homogénna časť:</b> \(x^2-x-2=(x-2)(x+1)\), teda \(d_n=\alpha2^n+\beta(-1)^n\).<br><b>Partikulárne:</b> 1 nie je koreň, \(b_n=An+B\):</p>
      <div class="disp">\[An+B-\big(A(n-1)+B\big)-2\big(A(n-2)+B\big)=-2An+5A-2B=4n\ \Rightarrow\ A=-2,\ B=-5.\]</div>
      <p>\(T(n)=\alpha2^n+\beta(-1)^n-2n-5\). Z \(T(0)=0\): \(\alpha+\beta=5\). Z \(T(1)=0\): \(2\alpha-\beta=7\). Odtiaľ \(\alpha=4,\ \beta=1\).</p>
      <div class="ans"><b>Výsledok</b>\(T(n)=2^{n+2}+(-1)^n-2n-5\), \(n\ge0\)</div>
      <p class="check" style="margin-top:8px">Kontrola: \(T(2)=8\)&nbsp;✓, \(T(3)=0+8+0+12=20\)&nbsp;✓, \(T(4)=8+20+8+16=52\)&nbsp;✓</p>
    </div></details>
  </article>
</div>
</section>

