  <article class="problem">
    <div class="p-head"><span class="pts">3. (3b)</span><a class="tag" href="#typ-odhad">odhad ~</a></div>
    <p class="prompt">Určte výpočtom čo najpresnejšie (pomocou \(\sim\) notácie) počet hviezdičiek, ktoré vypíše procB.</p>
<pre class="code">void procB (int n) {
  int i,j,k;
  for (i=1; i&lt;=n; ++i)
    for (j=1; j&lt;=i; ++j)
      for (k=j; k&lt;=i; ++k)
        printf("**");
}</pre>
    <details class="sol"><summary><span class="closed-label">Ukázať riešenie</span><span class="open-label">Riešenie</span></summary><div class="sol-body">
      <p>Najvnútornejší cyklus: \(k=j,\dots,i\), teda \(i-j+1\) prechodov. Pre pevné \(i\): \(\sum_{j=1}^{i}(i-j+1)\) \(=i+(i-1)+\dots+1\) \(=\frac{i(i+1)}{2}\).</p>
      <div class="disp">\[T(n)=2\sum_{i=1}^{n}\frac{i(i+1)}{2}=\sum_{i=1}^n(i^2+i)=\frac{n(n+1)(2n+1)}{6}+\frac{n(n+1)}{2}=\frac{n(n+1)(n+2)}{3}.\]</div>
      <div class="ans"><b>Výsledok</b>\(T(n)\sim\dfrac{n^3}{3}\)</div>
    </div></details>
  </article>

  <article class="problem">
    <div class="p-head"><span class="pts">4. (2+2+1b)</span><a class="tag" href="#typ-mt">master theorem</a></div>
    <p class="prompt">Použite Master Theorem na riešenie rekurencií. Riešenia zdôvodnite!<br>a)&nbsp;\(T(n)=4T(n/2)+n\log n\), &nbsp; b)&nbsp;\(T(n)=4T(n/2)+n^2\log n\), &nbsp; c)&nbsp;\(T(n)=4T(n/2)+n^3\).</p>
    <details class="sol"><summary><span class="closed-label">Ukázať riešenie</span><span class="open-label">Riešenie</span></summary><div class="sol-body">
      <p>Všade \(p=\log_2 4=2\).</p>
      <p><b>a)</b> \(d=1&lt;2\), \(\varepsilon=\tfrac12\): \(\lim\frac{n\log n}{n^{3/2}}=\lim\frac{\log n}{\sqrt n}=0\), teda MT1.</p>
      <div class="ans"><b>a)</b>\(T(n)=\Theta(n^2)\)</div>
      <p style="margin-top:14px"><b>b)</b> \(f=\Theta(n^2\log^1 n)\), teda MT2 s \(k=1\).</p>
      <div class="ans"><b>b)</b>\(T(n)=\Theta(n^2\log^2 n)\)</div>
      <p style="margin-top:14px"><b>c)</b> \(d=3&gt;2\), \(\varepsilon=1\). Regularita: \(4(n/2)^3=\frac12n^3\), \(c=\frac12&lt;1\)&nbsp;✓, teda MT3.</p>
      <div class="ans"><b>c)</b>\(T(n)=\Theta(n^3)\)</div>
    </div></details>
  </article>

  <article class="problem">
    <div class="p-head"><span class="pts">5. (5b)</span><a class="tag" href="#typ-rekurzia">rekurencia</a></div>
    <p class="prompt">Určte výpočtom presný počet hviezdičiek, ktoré vypíše procC.</p>
<pre class="code">void procC (int n) {
  int i;
  if (n&gt;0) {
    procC(n-1);
    for (i=0; i&lt;n; i++)
