  }
}</pre>
    <details class="sol"><summary><span class="closed-label">Ukázať riešenie</span><span class="open-label">Riešenie</span></summary><div class="sol-body">
      <div class="disp">\[T(n)=2T(n-1)+2n+1,\qquad T(0)=0.\]</div>
      <p>\(d_n=\alpha2^n\). Partikulárne \(b_n=An+B\):</p>
      <div class="disp">\[An+B=2A(n-1)+2B+2n+1\ \Rightarrow\ 0=(A+2)n+(B-2A+1)\ \Rightarrow\ A=-2,\ B=-5.\]</div>
