  <article class="problem">
    <div class="p-head"><span class="pts">1. (2+2b)</span><a class="tag" href="#typ-vztahy">tabuľka vzťahov</a></div>
    <p class="prompt">Rozhodnite o každom zo vzťahov \((O,o,\Omega,\omega,\Theta,\sim)\) medzi funkciami \(f,g\), resp. \(F,G\) a svoje tvrdenie zdôvodnite výpočtom príslušnej limity.<br>(a)&nbsp;\(f(n)=n\log_2 n+n\), \(g(n)=\log_2(n!)\). &nbsp; (b)&nbsp;\(F(n)=3^{\log_2 n}\), \(G(n)=n^{3/2}\).</p>
    <details class="sol"><summary><span class="closed-label">Ukázať riešenie</span><span class="open-label">Riešenie</span></summary><div class="sol-body">
      <p><b>(a)</b> Zo Stirlingovej formuly \(n!\sim\sqrt{2\pi n}(n/e)^n\):</p>
      <div class="disp">\[\log_2 n!=n\log_2 n-n\log_2 e+\tfrac12\log_2(2\pi n)+o(1).\]</div>
      <p>Vydeľ \(n\log_2 n\): \(\dfrac{g}{n\log_2 n}\to1\) a \(\dfrac{f}{n\log_2 n}=1+\dfrac{1}{\log_2 n}\to1\), takže \(L=1\).</p>
      <p><b>(b)</b> Prepíš \(3=2^{\log_2 3}\):</p>
      <div class="disp">\[3^{\log_2 n}=\big(2^{\log_2 3}\big)^{\log_2 n}=\big(2^{\log_2 n}\big)^{\log_2 3}=n^{\log_2 3}\approx n^{1{,}585}.\]</div>
      <p>Potom \(\dfrac FG=n^{\log_2 3-1{,}5}=n^{0{,}085}\to\infty\).</p>
      <div class="scroll"><table class="rel">
        <thead><tr><th></th><th>\(O\)</th><th>\(o\)</th><th>\(\Omega\)</th><th>\(\omega\)</th><th>\(\Theta\)</th><th>\(\sim\)</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>(a)&nbsp;\(L=1\)</td><td class="y">✓</td><td class="n">×</td><td class="y">✓</td><td class="n">×</td><td class="y">✓</td><td class="y">✓</td></tr>
          <tr><td>(b)&nbsp;\(L=\infty\)</td><td class="n">×</td><td class="n">×</td><td class="y">✓</td><td class="y">✓</td><td class="n">×</td><td class="n">×</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table></div>
    </div></details>
  </article>

  <article class="problem">
    <div class="p-head"><span class="pts">2. (3b)</span><a class="tag" href="#typ-cykly">presný počet</a></div>
    <p class="prompt">Určte výpočtom presný počet hviezdičiek, ktoré vypíše procA.</p>
<pre class="code">void procA (int n) {
  int i,j;
