}</pre>
    <details class="sol"><summary><span class="closed-label">Ukázať riešenie</span><span class="open-label">Riešenie</span></summary><div class="sol-body">
      <p>\(i=1,\dots,2n\): \(2n\) prechodov. Klesajúci cyklus \(j=3n,\dots,i+1\): \(3n-i\) prechodov (kladné, lebo \(i\le2n\)).</p>
      <div class="disp">\[T(n)=\sum_{i=1}^{2n}\big(1+3(3n-i)\big)=2n+3\Big(6n^2-\frac{2n(2n+1)}{2}\Big)=2n+3(4n^2-n).\]</div>
      <div class="ans"><b>Výsledok</b>\(T(n)=12n^2-n\) pre \(n\ge0\)</div>
      <p class="check" style="margin-top:8px">Kontrola \(n=1\): \(i=1\): \(1+6=7\); \(i=2\): \(1+3=4\); spolu 11&nbsp;✓</p>
    </div></details>
