  <article class="problem">
    <div class="p-head"><span class="pts">4. (2+2+1b)</span><a class="tag" href="#typ-mt">master theorem</a></div>
    <p class="prompt">Použite Master Theorem na riešenie rekurencií. Riešenia zdôvodnite!<br>a)&nbsp;\(T(n)=3T(n/2)+n\log n\), &nbsp; b)&nbsp;\(T(n)=16T(n/4)+n^2\), &nbsp; c)&nbsp;\(T(n)=3T(n/9)+n\).</p>
    <details class="sol"><summary><span class="closed-label">Ukázať riešenie</span><span class="open-label">Riešenie</span></summary><div class="sol-body">
      <p><b>a)</b> \(p=\log_2 3\approx1{,}585\), \(d=1&lt;p\). Pre \(\varepsilon=0{,}5\): \(\lim\frac{n\log n}{n^{1{,}085}}=\lim\frac{\log n}{n^{0{,}085}}=0\), teda MT1.</p>
      <div class="ans"><b>a)</b>\(T(n)=\Theta(n^{\log_2 3})\)</div>
      <p style="margin-top:14px"><b>b)</b> \(p=\log_4 16=2\), \(f=n^2=\Theta(n^2\log^0 n)\), teda MT2.</p>
      <div class="ans"><b>b)</b>\(T(n)=\Theta(n^2\log n)\)</div>
      <p style="margin-top:14px"><b>c)</b> \(p=\log_9 3=\tfrac12\), \(d=1&gt;\tfrac12\), \(\varepsilon=\tfrac12\). Regularita: \(3\cdot\frac n9=\frac13n\), \(c=\frac13\)&nbsp;✓, teda MT3.</p>
      <div class="ans"><b>c)</b>\(T(n)=\Theta(n)\)</div>
    </div></details>
  </article>

  <article class="problem">
    <div class="p-head"><span class="pts">5. (5b)</span><a class="tag" href="#typ-rekurzia">rekurencia</a></div>
    <p class="prompt">Určte výpočtom presný počet hviezdičiek, ktoré vypíše procC.</p>
<pre class="code">void procC (int n) {
  int i;
  if (n&gt;0) {
    procC(n-1);
    for (i=0; i&lt;n; i++)
      printf("**");
    procC(n-1);
    procC(n-1);
  }
}</pre>
    <details class="sol"><summary><span class="closed-label">Ukázať riešenie</span><span class="open-label">Riešenie</span></summary><div class="sol-body">
      <div class="disp">\[T(n)=3T(n-1)+2n,\qquad T(0)=0.\]</div>
      <p>\(d_n=\alpha3^n\). Partikulárne \(b_n=An+B\):</p>
      <div class="disp">\[An+B=3A(n-1)+3B+2n\ \Rightarrow\ 0=(2A+2)n+(2B-3A)\ \Rightarrow\ A=-1,\ B=-\tfrac32.\]</div>
